  "text_pages": [
    "GACHON UNIVERSITY - Buddy Program\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nBuddy Program\nGachon University assigns Korean student buddies to help you adapt to life in Korea.\nThere is no seperate application process - Korean student buddies are matched automatically, and they will contact you at the beginning of the semester.\nThroughout the semester, you can ask your buddy for help with both campus life and daily life in Korea.\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nReport abuse"
